g and you're able to chip in  even a dollar a month  i would greatly appreciate the support  you can find my patreon page  join our growing discord server and get  early access to every episode at  patreon.com  second thought if you enjoyed this video  consider dropping a like  if you hated it a thumbs down you can  check out my previous episodes by  clicking the links on your screen  thanks for watching and i'll see you  next week  you
 

